Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Hall of Echoes.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Embereth Shieldbreaker; Ability: becomes a copy)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

